I need an engineer. Who do I hire?\\n\\nYou know what you want built. You don't know how to say it like an engineer needs to hear it — and that gap is exactly where good projects stall.\\n\\nDrytis translates. You describe the outcome in your own words; the engineer gets what they need to actually build it.\\n\\nMEET DRYTIS\\nWe're not a coding model.\\nWe're a coding model wrapped in human judgment.\\n\\nAI writes software. Humans build companies. Drytis is the human part.\\n\\nYou describe what you want. AI builds it. The moment AI says it's done, a Drytis engineer takes over — reviewing the work, fixing what was missed, a\\n...[truncated 3776 chars]\",\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e1\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log In Start Building How it works ↓ Built with AI. Finished by engineers! From AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products. Start your build → See a real build Describe your idea in plain language. No technical background required. → AI isn’t the replac\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-5042,\"width\":1440,\"height\":900}},{\"id\":\"e2\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log In Start Building How it works ↓ Built with AI. Finished by engineers! From AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products. Start your build → See a real build Describe your idea in plain language. No technical background required. → AI isn’t the replac\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root > div\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-5042,\"width\":1440,\"height\":900}},{\"id\":\"e3\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log In Start Building How it works ↓ Built with AI. Finished by engineers! From AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products. Start your build → See a real build Describe your idea in plain language. No technical background required. → AI isn’t the replac\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root > div > div\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-5042,\"wid