m-right corner for a chat launcher.","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_84ab232e60dc4219ae4300c2","toolName":"browser_screenshot","input":{"fullPage":true,"quality":40}}]},{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_84ab232e60dc4219ae4300c2","toolName":"browser_screenshot","content":"{\"mimeType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"base64\":\"[base64 omitted: 494208 chars]\"}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_3bf7957ae3254c5680d76121","toolName":"browser_fill","input":{"selector":"#dr-chat-input","value":"Hello, I have a question about pricing"}}]},{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_3bf7957ae3254c5680d76121","toolName":"browser_fill","content":"{\"success\":false,\"error\":\"locator.fill: Timeout 30000ms exceeded.\\nCall log:\\n  - waiting for locator('#dr-chat-input')\\n    - locator resolved to <input type=\\\"text\\\" maxlength=\\\"2000\\\" id=\\\"dr-chat-input\\\" autocomplete=\\\"off\\\" aria-label=\\\"Your message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Ask about Drytis…\\\"/>\\n    - fill(\\\"Hello, I have a question about pricing\\\")\\n  - attempting fill action\\n    2 × waiting for element to be visible, enabled and editable\\n      - element is not visible\\n    - retrying fill action\\n    - waiting 20ms\\n    2 × waiting for element to be visible, enabled and editable\\n      - element is not visible\\n    - retrying fill action\\n      - waiting 100ms\\n    60 × waiting for element to be visible, enabled and editable\\n       - element is not visible\\n     - retrying fill action\\n       - waiting 500ms\\n\"}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The chat widget exists but is closed. Let me scroll to the footer to check contact options, and look for the chat launcher button.","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_edfd21cef27f4b5891263fed","toolName":"browser_scroll","input":{"y":5000,"x":0}}]},{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_edfd21cef27f4b5891263fed","toolName":"browser_scroll","content":"{\"success\":true,\"surface\":\"ide\",\"viewId\":\"tab-1\",\"url\":\"https://drytis.com/\",\"title\":\"\",\"visible\":true,\"loading\":false,\"canGoBack\":true,\"canGoForward\":true,\"annotationActive\":false,\"action\":\"scroll\"}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_fb8a32a0f76040a9ae51d63e","toolName":"browser_snapshot","input":{"limit":80}}]},{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_fb8a32a0f76040a9ae51d63e","toolName":"browser_snapshot","content":"{\"success\":true,\"surface\":\"ide\",\"viewId\":\"tab-1\",\"url\":\"https://drytis.com/\",\"title\":\"\",\"visible\":true,\"loading\":false,\"canGoBack\":true,\"canGoForward\":true,\"annotationActive\":false,\"viewport\":{\"width\":1440,\"height\":900,\"devicePixelRatio\":1},\"bodyText\":\"drytis\\nSolutions\\nPricing\\nAbout\\nBlog\\nCareers\\n☾\\nLog In\\nStart Building\\nHow it works ↓\\nBuilt with AI.\\nFinished by engineers!\\n\\nFrom AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products.\\n\\nStart your build\\n→\\nSee a real build\\n\\nDescribe your idea in plain language. No technical background required.\\n\\n→\\nAI isn’t the replacement. It’s the teammate.\\nTHE JOURNEY\\nEvery founder passes through this arc.\\nYOU KNOW THIS FEELING.\\nWhere do I even start?\\nI thought AI would get me there.\\nI can't do this by myself.\\nThe meetings go nowhere.\\nI need an engineer. Who do I hire?\\n\\nYou know what you want built. You don't know how to say it like an engineer needs to hear it — and that gap is exactly where good projects stall.\\n\\nDrytis translates. You describe the outcome in your own words; the engineer gets what they need to actually build it.\\n\\nMEET DRYTIS\\nWe're not a coding model.\\nWe're a coding model wrapped in human judgment.\\n\\nAI writes software. Humans build companies. Drytis is the human part.\\n\\nYou describe what you want. AI builds it. The moment AI says it's done, a Drytis engineer takes over — reviewing the work, fixing what was missed, a\\n...[truncated 3770 chars]\",\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e1\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log I