e29\",\"tagName\":\"span\",\"text\":\"with\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root > div > div > div > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > h1 > span:nth-of-type(2)\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":334.484375,\"y\":-280,\"width\":67.984375,\"height\":43.90625}},{\"id\":\"e30\",\"tagName\":\"span\",\"text\":\"AI.\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root > div > div > div > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > h1 > span:nth-of-type(3)\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":411.484375,\"y\":-280,\"width\":43.015625,\"height\":43.90625}}],\"elementCount\":149,\"theme\":{\"prefersColorScheme\":\"light\",\"colorScheme\":\"normal\",\"backgroundColor\":\"rgb(244, 246, 239)\",\"foregroundColor\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_c3dd82260b6d49ad9a070419","toolName":"browser_key","input":{"key":"Home"}}]},{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_c3dd82260b6d49ad9a070419","toolName":"browser_key","content":"{\"success\":true,\"surface\":\"ide\",\"viewId\":\"tab-1\",\"url\":\"https://drytis.com/\",\"title\":\"\",\"visible\":true,\"loading\":false,\"canGoBack\":true,\"canGoForward\":true,\"annotationActive\":false,\"action\":\"press\",\"navigated\":false}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_e3a3b0509da347a1b6860cf3","toolName":"browser_snapshot","input":{}}]},{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_e3a3b0509da347a1b6860cf3","toolName":"browser_snapshot","content":"{\"success\":true,\"surface\":\"ide\",\"viewId\":\"tab-1\",\"url\":\"https://drytis.com/\",\"title\":\"\",\"visible\":true,\"loading\":false,\"canGoBack\":true,\"canGoForward\":true,\"annotationActive\":false,\"viewport\":{\"width\":1440,\"height\":900,\"devicePixelRatio\":1},\"bodyText\":\"drytis\\nSolutions\\nPricing\\nAbout\\nBlog\\nCareers\\n☾\\nLog In\\nStart Building\\nHow it works ↓\\nBuilt with AI.\\nFinished by engineers!\\n\\nFrom AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products.\\n\\nStart your build\\n→\\nSee a real build\\n\\nDescribe your idea in plain language. No technical background required.\\n\\n→\\nAI isn’t the replacement. It’s the teammate.\\nTHE JOURNEY\\nEvery founder passes through this arc.\\nYOU KNOW THIS FEELING.\\nWhere do I even start?\\nI thought AI would get me there.\\nI can't do this by myself.\\nThe meetings go nowhere.\\nI need an engineer. Who do I hire?\\n\\nYou know what you want built. You don't know how to say it like an engineer needs to hear it — and that gap is exactly where good projects stall.\\n\\nDrytis translates. You describe the outcome in your own words; the engineer gets what they need to actually build it.\\n\\nMEET DRYTIS\\nWe're not a coding model.\\nWe're a coding model wrapped in human judgment.\\n\\nAI writes software. Humans build companies. Drytis is the human part.\\n\\nYou describe what you want. AI builds it. The moment AI says it's done, a Drytis engineer takes over — reviewing the work, fixing what was missed, a\\n...[truncated 3769 chars]\",\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e1\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log In Start Building How it works ↓ Built with AI. Finished by engineers! From AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products. Start your build → See a real build Describe your idea in plain language. No technical background required. → AI isn’t the replac\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-581,\"width\":1440,\"height\":900}},{\"id\":\"e2\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log In Start Building How it works ↓ Built with AI. Finished by engineers! From AI-generated ideas to launch-ready products. Start your build → See a real build Describe your idea in plain language. No technical background required. → AI isn’t the replac\",\"selector\":\"#dc-root > div\",\"boundingBox\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-581,\"width\":1440,\"height\":900}},{\"id\":\"e3\",\"tagName\":\"div\",\"text\":\"drytis Solutions Pricing About Blog Careers ☾ Log In Start Building How it works ↓ Built with AI. Finished by engineers! From AI-gen